<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuelan bolivar closes flat in slow trade.</title>
<headline>Venezuelan bolivar closes flat in slow trade.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed flat at 470.75/471.75 bolivars per dollar in a quiet market that saw some Central Bank intervention late in the day, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;The Central Bank came in very late and that's when people started to cover,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>The unit, which at one point softened to 472, closed Wednesday at 470.50/471.75.</p>
<p>-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
